{"ID":"20240515131413-q2xpv60","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131413-q2xpv60","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131413-q2xpv60\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140612-81d08yc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140612-81d08yc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140612-81d08yc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:453,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:482\u0026#125;","title":"060","type":"doc","updated":"20240515162521"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515140612-81d08yc","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 970px;","id":"20240515140612-81d08yc","updated":"20240515162521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LE"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"65岁 瘦小"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/22"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咳嗽坐不得卧复诊。（肺癌末期）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咳嗽仍多，但晚上三点后可平躺了，仍有胁痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"喉中偶然痒，会引起咳。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡眠：尚好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒热：时冷时热，无汗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃口：好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴：有，喜冷饮"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"体力：仍差"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昨日服藥後略下利"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脉仍弦细"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白红干"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺中有水气，无痰咳出"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桔梗 一两 炙甘草 五钱 麻黄 三钱 射干 三钱 紫菀 三钱 冬花 二钱半夏 三钱 麦冬 三钱 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五味子 二钱 干姜 二钱 生姜 二片 大枣 十枚党参 三钱  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拾付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9-3碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前服。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仍有三付8/12寄出的药未喝，先服今开的药"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解說： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、该病人一年前因肺癌末期来诊"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、昨因咳嗽一直不好，已经从肺中抽过一次痰水，仍咳嗽但坐不得卧而再诊，予半夏甘遂大枣汤，急泻胸肋之积水。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、今再诊，患者已可平躺，但仍咳嗽，时喉痒，知其胸肋积水已去，然肺中仍有水气。重用 桔梗 一两 炙甘草 五钱 托排肺中积痰，利肺气予射干麻黄汤去细辛，以去肺中水气。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"问：为何去细辛？是否因患者口渴喜冷饮，中有热故?倪師答：對"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、干姜 生姜 大枣 党参，增补肠胃津液"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}